<section class="hhero">
  <div class="eyebrow"><i></i> Tacos Jalisco · Vallejo CA</div>
  <h1>We&rsquo;re <em>Hiring</em></h1>
</section>

<main class="wrap">

  <!-- OPEN ROLES (shown when hiring is ON in config.js) -->
  <div id="hiringOpenBlock">
    <div class="roles">
      <article class="role">
        <div class="role__head"><h2>Line Cook</h2><span class="role__type">Full / Part-time</span></div>
        <p>Work the grill and the birria pots in a fast, friendly kitchen. Experience with Mexican cooking is a plus — a good attitude matters more. We train.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="role">
        <div class="role__head"><h2>Prep Cook</h2><span class="role__type">Full / Part-time</span></div>
        <p>Morning prep: salsas, marinades, produce and beans, made fresh every day. Early shifts, steady hours, no late nights.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="role">
        <div class="role__head"><h2>Cashier / Counter</h2><span class="role__type">Part-time</span></div>
        <p>Take orders in person and by phone, keep pickup and delivery moving, and make every guest feel like a regular. Spanish and English both welcome.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="role">
        <div class="role__head"><h2>Server</h2><span class="role__type">Part-time</span></div>
        <p>Look after the dining room — seat guests, run plates, keep the aguas frescas flowing. Weekend availability preferred.</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="jobform-card" id="apply">
      <div class="jobform-head">
        <h3>Join a growing team <em>with a love for food.</em></h3>
        <p class="jobform-sub">Apply today &mdash; fill out this quick form with your resume and a few sentences about yourself.</p>
        <span class="jobform-loc">Vallejo &middot; 3420 Sonoma Blvd</span>
      </div>

      <!-- ═══ APPLICATION FORM ═══
           Submits to an AWS Lambda Function URL (JOBFORM_ENDPOINT below),
           which notifies the restaurant owner by email + SMS via
           boons-notification-api. See /doc/design.md for the full design. -->
      <form class="jobform" id="jobform" novalidate>
        <input type="text" name="_honey" style="display:none" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">

        <div class="jobform__cell">
          <select name="Position" aria-label="Position applying for *" required>
            <option value="" disabled selected>Position applying for *</option>
            <option>Line Cook</option>
            <option>Prep Cook</option>
            <option>Cashier / Counter</option>
            <option>Server</option>
            <option>Other / Any role</option>
          </select>
          <span class="jobform__msg" role="alert"></span>
        </div>

        <div class="jobform__cell">
          <input type="text" name="Name" placeholder="Full name *" autocomplete="name" autocapitalize="words" spellcheck="false" maxlength="50" inputmode="text" pattern="[A-Za-zÁÉÍÓÚÜÑáéíóúüñ]+( [A-Za-zÁÉÍÓÚÜÑáéíóúüñ]+)*" title="Letters only — no numbers or special characters. Maximum 50 characters." required>
          <span class="jobform__msg" role="alert"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="jobform__grid">
          <div class="jobform__cell">
            <input type="email" name="Email" placeholder="Email *" autocomplete="email" inputmode="email" maxlength="80" spellcheck="false" title="Enter an email like name@example.com" required>
            <span class="jobform__msg" role="alert"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="jobform__cell">
            <input type="tel" name="Phone" placeholder="Phone number *  (555) 123-4567" autocomplete="tel" inputmode="numeric" maxlength="14" pattern="\(\d{3}\) \d{3}-\d{4}" title="Enter a US phone number, e.g. (707) 647-0554." required>
            <span class="jobform__msg" role="alert"></span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="jobform__cell">
          <textarea name="Comment" id="jfComment" rows="3" placeholder="A few sentences about yourself" maxlength="2000" title="Maximum 2,000 characters."></textarea>
          <span class="jobform__msg" role="alert"></span>
        </div>

        <label class="jobform__file" for="jfFile">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 16V4M7 9l5-5 5 5M5 20h14"/></svg>
          <span id="jfFileLabel">Attach your resume (PDF, max 3 MB)</span>
          <input type="file" id="jfFile" name="Resume" accept="application/pdf">
        </label>
        <p class="jobform__req">Either a comment or a resume is required · PDF max 3 MB</p>

        <div class="jobform__ok" id="jfOk">&#10003; You&rsquo;re all set &mdash; we received your application.</div>
        <div class="jobform__err" id="jfErr">Couldn&rsquo;t send right now &mdash; please call <a href="tel:+17076470554" style="text-decoration:underline">+1 707-647-0554</a> or try again.</div>

        <button class="btn btn--solid" type="submit" id="jfBtn"><span>Submit</span></button>
      </form>
    </div>

    <div class="apply">
      <h3>Prefer to talk?</h3>
      <p>Come by and say hello at 3420 Sonoma Blvd, or reach us directly.</p>
      <div class="apply__btns">
        <a class="btn btn--solid" href="mailto:tacosjaliscovallejo@gmail.com?subject=Job%20application%20%E2%80%94%20Tacos%20Jalisco"><span>Email us</span></a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="tel:+17076470554"><span>Call +1 707-647-0554</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- CLOSED NOTICE (shown when hiring is OFF in config.js) -->
  <div id="hiringClosedBlock" hidden>
    <div class="closed">
      <h2>No openings right now</h2>
      <p>We&rsquo;re fully staffed at the moment — but the family is always growing. Check back soon, or follow us to hear about the next opening first.</p>
      <a class="btn btn--solid" href="./"><span>Back to home</span></a>
    </div>
